litert: support 0-runtime-input and 5D tensors in the GPU delegate

Allows RESHAPE/TRANSPOSE with 0 runtime inputs (constant data tensors)
and rank-5 tensors through the GPU delegate:

- relax the GPU-compat check to accept 0 or 1 runtime inputs for
  RESHAPE/TRANSPOSE (previously exactly 1);
- accept constant and >=5D inputs in the elementwise parser, registering
  >=5D constants as graph inputs instead of folding them into BHWC
  attributes;
- constant-fold 0-runtime-input RESHAPE/TRANSPOSE into CONSTANT nodes;
- emit Reshape3DAttributes/Transpose3DAttributes (BHWDC) for rank-5
  reshape/transpose;
- allow rank-5 tensors in IsAllAllowedTensors (reject only 6D+).

Merges former patches 09, 16, 17, 18, 19.

